  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the charm of the countryside with our Jeminise farmhouse quilt set, featuring classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless look. Perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom, this quilt set can be personalized with a name and is available in multiple sizes.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Elegance:</strong> Features classic farmhouse patterns and soft fabrics for a cozy, timeless aesthetic in any bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name for a unique and thoughtful touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from Polycotton fabric for comfort and durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
